 (package neural_nets_lib)
 (deps
  ocannl_config
  ; The scanner enumerates this source tree inside a required clean sandbox. That preserves exact
  ; path boundaries without putting the 37 KB expansion on a spawned command line. The action's
  ; non-source occupants are its executable, output target and mandatory copied `ocannl_config`;
  ; all three are passed below as exclusions so a listed generated path cannot produce a false
  ; green.
